# era-bank-core — module map (ops API)

Kernel routes consumed by `era-bank` BFF (prefix `/api/v1/`).

## GL (ledger)

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/gl/accounts` | Chart of accounts |
| GET | `/gl/trial-balance` | Trial balance snapshot |
| POST | `/accounts` | Open customer account |
| GET | `/accounts` | List — filters `customerId`, `branchId`, `iban`, `status` |
| GET | `/accounts/:id` | Detail + holds |
| GET | `/accounts/:id/statement` | Movements `from` / `to` |
| POST | `/accounts/:id/close` | Close — zero available balance, no ACTIVE holds |
| POST | `/accounts/:id/holds` | Place hold |
| DELETE | `/accounts/:id/holds/:holdId` | Release hold |

## Postings

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/postings` | Queue — `status`, `branchId`, `type`, dates |
| GET | `/postings/:id` | Detail + legs |
| POST | `/postings/cash-deposit` | Teller template |
| POST | `/postings/cash-withdrawal` | Teller template |
| POST | `/postings/internal-transfer` | Teller template |
| POST | `/postings/:id/approve` | Checker from JWT |
| POST | `/postings/:id/reject` | PENDING → REJECTED |
| POST | `/postings/:id/reverse` | Reversal |

## Branches

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| POST | `/branches/cross-branch-withdrawal` | MFR wrapper |

## CIF

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/cif/customers?q=` | Search FIN/VÖEN/ID |
| POST | `/cif/customers` | Onboard NATURAL/LEGAL |

## Payments / deposits / loans

| Module | Routes |
|--------|--------|
| Payments | `GET/POST /payments/orders`, `GET /payments/orders/:id`, `POST .../submit`, `POST /payments/inbound` |
| Deposits | `GET/POST /deposits`, `GET /deposits/:id`, `POST .../close`, `POST .../rollover` (maturity extend only) |
| Loans | `GET/POST /loans`, `GET /loans/:id`, `GET .../schedule`, `POST .../disburse`, `.../repay`, `.../restructure` |

## Product factory

| Method | Path |
|--------|------|
| GET | `/product-templates` |
| POST | `/product-templates` |

## EOD

| Method | Path |
|--------|------|
| POST | `/eod/run` |
| GET | `/eod/:date` |
